<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Amt> linkml:description "A decimal number that is a quantity multiplied by a price." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Boolean> linkml:description "A character that is Y or N." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Country> linkml:description "A two-letter country code of ISO 3166-1." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Currency> linkml:description "A three-letter currency code of ISO 4217." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/DayOfMonth> linkml:description "A whole number from 1 to 31." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/EncodedText> linkml:description "Text in the character set a field beside it names, rather than ASCII." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Exchange> linkml:description "A market identifier code of ISO 10383." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Language> linkml:description "A language code of ISO 639-1." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Length> linkml:description "A whole number that counts the octets of another field." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/LocalMktDate> linkml:description "A calendar date in the market's local time." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/LocalMktTime> linkml:description "A time of day in the market's local time." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/MonthYear> linkml:description "A year and month, with an optional day or week." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/MultipleCharValue> linkml:description "One or more single characters, separated by spaces, each chosen from a list." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/MultipleStringValue> linkml:description "One or more words, separated by spaces, each chosen from a list." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/NumInGroup> linkml:description "A whole number that counts the entries of a repeating group." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Pattern> linkml:description "Text that another field's value must match." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Percentage> linkml:description "A decimal number that is a proportion, where 0.1 is ten percent." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Price> linkml:description "A decimal number that is a price." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/PriceOffset> linkml:description "A decimal number that is a difference from a price." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Qty> linkml:description "A decimal number that is an amount of something traded." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Reserved1000Plus> linkml:description "A whole number of 1000 or more, kept for values a counterparty defines." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Reserved100Plus> linkml:description "A whole number of 100 or more, kept for values a counterparty defines." .
<https://w3id.org/lmodel/fix-sbe/Reserved4000Plus> linkml:description "A whole number of 4000 or more, kept for values a counterparty defines." .
