	linkml:description "A LinkML model of FIX Simple Binary Encoding, a standard from the FIX Trading Community for encoding messages in binary. It describes SBE message schemas: encodings, message templates, fields, groups and variable-length data. The two editions differ on the wire and in their XML, so each has a module of its own." ;
